<h2 id="categories-section-introduction" class="tex-section"><span data-tag="0012">4.1</span> Introduction</h2>

<p>
Categories were first introduced in <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/GenEqui">GenEqui</a>]</span>. The category of categories (which is a proper class) is a $2$-category. Similarly, the category of stacks forms a $2$-category. If you already know about categories, but not about $2$-categories you should read Section <a href="/tag/003D" data-tag="003D">4.28</a> as an introduction to the formal definitions later on. 
</p>
